version id
Definition
The version identifier is a customer-specific identifier used to distinguish one version of the SETU Inquiry Pay Equity message from another.
Type
Identifier
https://hropenstandards.org/schema/xml/Identifier
Usage notes
It is important not to confuse this with the document number, which is the identifier of this message.

